window.products.push({"id":355212,"name":"Tasse Verre 11x13 Picture Frame Black (2-pack) - HIGH DEFINITION GLASS FRONT COVER - Displays 11 by 13\" Picture w/o Mat or an 8x10 Photo w/Mat - Verti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cUOd4yRiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wood Frame with High Definition Glass Front - SAVE WHEN YOU BUY MULTIPLES - SAVE 5% WHEN YOU BUY 2 SETS, SAVE 7% WHEN YOU BUY 3 SETS, SAVE 10% WHEN YOU BUY 4 SETS. USE COUPON CODE \"PHOTOLUV\" MAKE YOUR PHOTOS LOOK GREAT : All of your favorite memories can be documented and pampered in these stunning and elegant 11x13 picture frames that will compliment and enhance your 8x10 photos with the included wide mat. DON’T WAIT, GET YOURS TODAY! ADD ELEGANCE AND CLASS TO YOUR PHOTOS : You will get many compliments when friends and family see your photos in these black 11x13” wood frames and a glass front cover (not cheap plastic) with a timeless, neutral look that will never go out of style. HURRY, Click the ADD TO CART Button Now! VERSATILE : EASY TO HANG BOTH HORIZONTALLY AND VERTICALLY : These 11 by 13 inch photo frames can be hung on the wall horizontally or vertically and are best for 8 by 10 inch portrait and landscape pictures. Each frame comes “READY TO HANG” with 2 sawtooth hanging hooks pre-installed and already attached to the back of the poster frame - NO HARDWARE INSTALLATION NEEDED. EVERY DETAIL IS DESIGNED TO PAMPER YOUR PICTURES : From the sawtooth hooks, the swivel tabs on the back (for easy opening and made to last), and the precision cut wide matting, these 11x13 inch photo frames will protect and proudly display your photos, certificates, diplomas, artwork, ribbons, medals, awards, magazines, your drawings, etc.. ORDER NOW WITH NO RISK! 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - We are so confident you will love these 11 by 14 inch frames that we offer 30 days Money Back Guarantee with one year warranty! These 11x14 frames with mat combine great quality and exquisite design. Proud to be a U.S. based company.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cUOd4yRiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tasse Verre","source_asin":"B07YGTXGJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YGTXGJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YGTXGJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":355213,"name":"Christmas Paisley Wooden Rolling Pin Embossing 3D Laser Engraved Patterned Rolling Pin for Baking Crusts Pies Cookies Biscuit Fondant Cake Dough Pastr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yK+MRUAaL._AC_.jpg","description":"HOW TO MAKE COOKIES WITH OUR EMBOSSED ROLLING PIN ? 230g unsalted butter. 175g confectioner’s (icing) sugar. 1 Egg (room temperature). 1.5-3 Teaspoons extract or emulsion (any flavor). 1 Teaspoon salt. 400-425g all-purpose flour. 1.Cream together butter and sugar. 2.Add eggs and extract and mix well. 3.Sift together flour and salt, add to wet mixture little by little until well incorporated. 4.Roll, emboss and cut cookies into desired shapes, dusting with flour as necessary. 5.Bake cookies at 200 Celsius for 7-8 minutes until tops are appear dry rather than shiny. 6.The secret is to pre -heat well the oven, and apply the right amount of pressure on the dough. CARE OF THE ROLLING PIN: Before using, brush the Paisley embossing rolling pin with vegetable oil or olive oil. Wash dry with a brush first, then if needed with water, soap and dry well before using again! Do not wash our embossing rolling pin in a dishwasher and try to avoid prolonged contact with water. Dry it thoroughly and apply a layer of vegetable oil or olive oil (Keep away from direct sunlight). Product Description Our wooden rolling pin was easy to use and maintance. Note: Do not leave it in the water,soak or wash the rolling pin in the dishwasher. After cleaning, dry it with a dry cloth. Regularly apply vegetable oil to it in a dry environment to prevent cracking. Specification: Material: natural wood Color: wood color  Size: 15.35 inch*2 inch  Maintenance method: prevent from being cool, do not soak in water Uses: making biscuits, pastries, pizza, etc. Package included: 1*Christmas wood rolling pin","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yK+MRUAaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xunlimen","source_asin":"B07L5RNQN3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L5RNQN3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L5RNQN3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
