window.products.push({"id":355226,"name":"Hand Made In USA Matte/Shiny Brushed Silver Stripes Double Walled 3-Quart Insulated Ice Bucket With Ice Tongs (Metallic Deco Collection)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xO3WMq60L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tall and slim, these 3-Quart, American-made ice buckets make for a bold statement. From our Metallic Deco Collection, this 3-quart ice bucket features the sleek and durable mylar which mimics the look of metal but is easier to clean and maintain. Available in both silver and gold, brushed and reflective metal finishes. Comes with a clear lid and metallic knob and handle. This 3-quart insulated and double walled ice bucket is Hand Made in the USA. Measuring L 7.75\" x W 7.75\" x H 8\", this ice bucket is perfect for cooling wine, champagne, soda, or even snacks. It can also work as a fashion coordinated centerpiece for plants or flowers. Made of food grade stainless steel, this bucket is designed to look attractive on any table in virtually any setting. Double insulation and walls mean no messy condensation rings will form on your table or the bucket. Condensation free surface that holds ice for anywhere between 3-5 hours. Ships with a lid and ice tongs. Design: Matte/Shiny Brushed Silver Stripes Capacity: 3-Quart Size: 7.75\" X 7.75\" X 8\" Made In USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xO3WMq60L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Ice Bucket By Stephanie Imports","source_asin":"B08NCBP1SP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NCBP1SP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NCBP1SP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
