window.products.push({"id":355492,"name":"Laura Ashley 5x7 White Enamel Picture Frame, Rose Gold Metal Edge with Easel, for Countertop, Counterspace, Tabletop Display, Bookshelf, Desk, Wall Dé","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CtZcrw-eL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Laura Ashley rose gold and white metal enamel frame provides a stylish boost to your home decor while helping transform any room into a more inviting living space. The understated elegance to this classic and contemporary frame is noticeable in the trim, metallic inner and outer edges that surround the enamel border. The chic look of the thin metallic edges reflects the tradition that inspired this modern frame. Light is reflected in a subtle way off this metallic frame and it brightens the tiniest of spaces. The feeling created by seeing your memories displayed in classic, yet modern style may also fill you with a sense of warmth. Feel free to rest this frame either vertically or horizontally on any shelf, mantlepiece, or countertop. The fabric easel of this frame is soft to the touch, yet sturdy. To insert a photo, simply slide the easel down. This frame’s glossy edges give it a clean look that makes it shine as a decorative piece. Gazing at the family portrait shots preserved in this gorgeous frame may bring back cherished memories while the frame accentuates the décor of your interior spaces. Take snapshots of your favorite everyday moments and turn them into timeless treasures in this stunning frame. The alluring quality of this frame make it an ideal choice for use as a display frame at big events like wedding receptions, birthday parties or anniversaries. All eyes will be drawn to the beauty within the frame wherever you place this photo. Use the built-in hooks to mount the frame on a wall and create your own art gallery. A series of black-and-white cityscape shots may transform a blank wall while bringing history to life. Share the joy these decorative frames bring you with your friends, family, and co-workers, as they make a thoughtful gift for the holidays or any season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CtZcrw-eL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B0844XZ527","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0844XZ527","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0844XZ527","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
