window.products.push({"id":355511,"name":"BioGreenChoice 12 5/8in. x 10 in. Eco-Friendly Fiber-Molded Bagasse/Natural Sugarcane Disposable Platter | Microwave Safe Platter (50 Count)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HAuwEdHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️Size: 12 5/8 in. x 10 in. Eco-Friendly Fiber/Bagasse Platter (50 pieces per pack). BioGreenChoice Platters are sturdy, durable and earth-friendly ✔️Disposable: BioGreenChoice Bagasse Platters are the perfect green alternative to disposable paper and plastic platter. These platters are intended for single use, and to be thrown away when finished. They are a great choice for use in a variety of industries, such as: hotels, cafeterias, catered events, parties, homes and more. ✔️Eco Friendly: Our platters are made from fibers (called bagasse) left behind from sugarcane/plant processing. Bagasse is a sustainable fiber that is a strong, durable alternative to traditional fibers derived from wood. ✔️Quality Assured: BioGreenChoice Bagasse platters can handle a wide range of temperatures (up to 220°F), which makes them suitable for hot and cold foods. They are soak proof, useful in serving foods with and without sauces. The platters are microwaveable and freezer safe. ✔️ Certified for food contact: All BioGreenChoice meet the necessary requirements for food contact","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HAuwEdHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BioGreenChoice","source_asin":"B08D9PVBJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D9PVBJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D9PVBJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":355512,"name":"RekRang Hand-Painted Goldfish Cast Iron Teapot Set Japanese Style Tetsubin Tea Kettle Set With Removeable Infuser and 4 Stainless Steel Cups for Stove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l2ZItwKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Exquisite Design】The teapot boby is a hand-painted goldfish pattern, with water ripples on the body of the kettle, which is like a pair of fish playing, lifelike, and the 4 matching stainless steel teacups are also painted with a golden double fish shape, exquisite and generous. The handle is wrapped with hemp rope, which is heat-insulating and anti-scalding,the iron trivet protects your desktop from damage, The exquisite design of the iron pot set makes drinking tea a pleasure. 【Study&Durable】The iron kettle is made of pig iron, which is hard and wear-resistant. The interior adopts 1200-degree high-temperature oxidation process, enamel lining, effective rust prevention and safe drinking water. The iron teapot conducts heat evenly, quickly, and has a good thermal insulation effect. The teacup is made of stainless steel, which is heat-insulating and high-temperature resistant to prevent hot hands. 【Easy to Clean】The inside of the tea kettle is made of black enamel, which is shiny and smooth, adding a delicate feeling and easier to clean. After the cast iron teapot is used, pour out the remaining tea water and directly rinse the inner wall with clean water. There is no need to use cleaning utensils such as detergents and sponges. Please keep the kettle body dry after cleaning to avoid rusting of the iron kettle. 【Versatile Use】Cast iron kettle can be used on various stoves, such as gas stoves, alcohol stoves, induction cookers.The iron teapot has strong thermal conductivity and heat preservation, suitable for brewing all kinds of tea,the combination of the iron ions released by the iron kettle and the fluoride ions in the water makes the tea softer and sweeter.and release divalent iron that is easily absorbed by the human body, which can supplement the iron needed by the human body. 【Collection Value】The exquisite relief of this goldfish iron teapot is in harmony with modern life, and the play of pisces means wealth and beauty in Chinese culture. It is not only a practical kettle, but also to be appreciated as a work of art. It can also be collected as a collection. It is a beautiful enjoyment to put in the kitchen and living room, and it is also a perfect choice for family and friends as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l2ZItwKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RekRang","source_asin":"B0BHVFRJ8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHVFRJ8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHVFRJ8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
