window.products.push({"id":355586,"name":"6 PCS 3D Pumpkin Silicone Mold for Halloween Thanksgiving Christmas, Mini Pumpkin Candy Mold Chocolate Jelly Clay Molds for Baking, Cake Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BvMK6Mu3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"- 3 Pairs 3D pumpkin candy mold mini pumpkin silicone mold Halloween easy release chocolate jelly molds for fall baking Halloween thanksgiving Christmas candy, baking, cake decoration, soap making, chocolate,clay Chocolate molds features: Durable and heat-resistant: The 3D pumpkin candy molds are made of quality silicone material, tasteless and non-toxic, durable and heat-resistant, can withstand temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius), impermeable and easy to release or clean, can serve for many times use. Scope of usages: The mini pumpkin candy molds are designed with 3D pumpkin style for you to create cute and lifelike food, suitable for making cake, bread, mousse, jelly, cooked food, ice, pudding, jelly, chocolate, handmade soap, rice ball, candy and more. Silicone chocolate mold specifications: Halloween cake molds material: silicone Each pumpkin silicone mold size: approx. 2.24 x 1.65 x 1.02 inch  Cavity mold size: approx. 1.61 x 1.46 inch  Chocolate molds silicone color: pink  Halloween molds Quantity: 3 pairs silicone cake molds Halloween candle molds warm notices: Please allow 1-3 cm errors due to manual measurement.  Careful washing can extend the mold life, please clean and disinfect in boiling water before use, clean (don't use cool water to clean immediately when it's just taken out of the oven) and dry it (keep away from direct sunlight) after use.  Do not directly touch the open flame or close to the heat source (such as the oven heating tube).  It is recommended that you place the mold in the middle or upper position of the oven during baking, and keep the distance between the heating tube at least 2 inch/ 5 cm. Do not use the crisp button of the microwave oven.  Do not approach the pointed items or use steel balls and other hard cleaning tools.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BvMK6Mu3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topaquatic","source_asin":"B0BFQWJQVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQWJQVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQWJQVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
