window.products.push({"id":355593,"name":"Steinbach Chubby Irish Boy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":163.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MyX+eWkXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Kindness and pride are virtues that our Chubby Irish Boy embodies like no other. With his open and warmly nature he welcomes his guests. The bond with nature and the family makes him indulge in romantic thoughts every day. With his bird on one hand and the christmas tree on the other hand, this love is expressed even more. But our dear Irish boy likes traveling and learning about the world. True to the motto: \"Where my heart is, I am at home here\", he fell in love with the Erzgebirge as we do and has since then been a permanent guest at the Steinbach factory (hotel).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MyX+eWkXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Steinbach","source_asin":"B07WJHMJ97","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WJHMJ97","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WJHMJ97","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
