window.products.push({"id":355611,"name":"Sweet FanMuLin Metal LED Sign Decorative Bar LED Metal Wall Light Sign (LAS VEGAS)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616erydz3SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LED Metal Sign Light The retro nostalgic unique shape is very suitable for industrial style or the unique decoration space of the American country. For example, cafes, bars, shops and restaurants are very suitable. Random decoration can become the attraction of the whole space. The high-quality tinplate is used to create the surface and the outer frame. The reverse side is covered with MDF. It is hand-made, high-temperature paint, exquisite workmanship, practical and durable. The back side has a hanging hole, which is firm and safe. The nostalgic style, the American retro style, and the classics that are worth remembering are the time when the history of the river flows quietly, leaving us with the most precious wealth. Under the retro-old appearance, it always blends with an American-style lively temperament. Purely hand-made, the style is nostalgic and elegant, and the mottled traces that are all exposed outside, even without a little decoration, are the beauty that time brings us. Made of high quality wrought iron material, it is sturdy and durable. The wall-mounted continuation of the retro-old style, the surface of the mottled spray paint for the craft effect, the interpretation of the deep sense of the age and the sense of history, the color pattern of the wall decoration, retro and lovely more interesting and transparent. Features 1. Size: 19.48'' in lenght X 10.24'' in height X 2.2'' in thickness2. Material: Tin metal3. Battery: 2 x AA batteries required (not included) Attention 1. Store the light in a cool and dry place and remove batteries if product is not to be used for a long time.2. Please ensure the hook steady to prevent falling when hanging. Instructions Need 2*AA battery( not include) to use and turn on the ON/OFF switch. If no lighting, try replacing different brand battery or contact us to solve the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616erydz3SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet FanMuLin","source_asin":"B07XPM9VM5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XPM9VM5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XPM9VM5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
