window.products.push({"id":355647,"name":"SCOUT Bagette Market Tote, Large Reusable Grocery Bag with Burst-Proof Bottom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LryMAxgKL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"All-Weather Woven Polypropylene lining Wipe with Damp Cloth DURABLE, LONG LASTING reusable grocery bag was built to be dependable, no double bagging necessary. Two handle lengths allow you to carry over the shoulder or by hand. EXTRA ROOMY SIZE opens to a 12-inch square that is 15 inches high, 12 inches wide and 12 inches deep. Heavy-duty shoulder strap measures 10.5 inches long, handle measures 3 inches long. ALL-WEATHER WOVEN fabric is made of interwoven polypropylene creating a light, but strong and water-resistant material (like a tarp). This durable, easy-clean fabric holds its shape when wet, dries fast, and softens with wear BURST-PROOF BOTTOM is stable, allowing your bag to stand open in the checkout lane and stay upright in your trunk so your groceries arrive in perfect form. FOLD FLAT DESIGN is collapsible and allows for easy pantry or trunk storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LryMAxgKL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SCOUT","source_asin":"B07MJC84LK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MJC84LK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MJC84LK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":355648,"name":"Cybrtrayd Life of the Party Bite Size Stars Chocolate Candy Mold in Sealed Protective Poly Bag Imprinted with Copyrighted Cybrtrayd Molding Instructio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uL5NtijoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques. To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision. Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uL5NtijoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B00EU6CVJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EU6CVJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EU6CVJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
