window.products.push({"id":355759,"name":"Chakra Tapestry Wall hanging Colorful Chakra tapestry Washable Zen tapestry Wall hanging,Indian Yoga Meditation Tapestry, Meditation mat,Room,Student ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E8sHUqM4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Why choose our tapestry: 1. [Super Skin-friendly]: This Tapestry is made of better Materials: Spandex with Velvet Layer added, which is much softer, more comfortable than other tapestries, also suitable for other use such as bedspread, tablecloth, etc. 2. [Thicker and Heavier]: It's 2-3 times thicker and heavier than most other same size tapestries, (weight 1.3 lb.=590g approx), making it not see through and lasting much longer. Unique design: The seven-veined Indian Mandala tapestry combines a variety of elements with colorful mandala as the background. Suitable for yoga and meditation, it makes you feel very quiet and comfortable. It is also ideal for home or studio decoration. It is a great creative design. Various usages: This psychedelic tapestry can not only be hung on the walls, but can also be used as ceiling decoration, yoga room decoration, meditation mats, beach blankets, bed sheets, curtains and beach blankets, dormitories, etc. It can also be given as a gift to friends and family, which is also a good choice. Cleaning method: Dry cleaning or cold water washing, machine washable,dry but do not hang in direct sunlight for a long time. You can iron at low temperatures, but not at high temperatures. Tips: 1. Please understand the chromatic aberration caused by lighting and screen effects. 2. Due to manual measurement, please allow slight measurement errors. Thank you for your understanding. Special attention items: In order to facilitate packaging and transportation, it will be folded during transportation, which may cause some creases. Please rest assured that it will not affect the use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E8sHUqM4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHANSHUIART","source_asin":"B096TFFQMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096TFFQMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096TFFQMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
