window.products.push({"id":355794,"name":"Milk Frother, USB Rechargeable Electric Handheld Milk Foam Maker with 2 Stainless whisks, 3 Speeds Adjustable Milk Mixer for Cappuccino, Latte, Bullet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t479myj-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❗❗❗ NOTE: Before use, you must hold the body of the whisk (close to the head) with your hands; when using, the head of the whisk is facing down to get a better experience. ☕ Rechargeable Battery: Besides the compact and lightweight body, The Milk Frother has a rechargeable built-in battery, maximizing its portability and convenience, saving your money, and can be carried easily everywhere. ☕ ✔ Get your Lattes with just one button 1. Speeds to choose from 2. One charge can last a long time 3. Different speeds suit different scenarios ✔ USB Rechargeable Milk Frother 1. 1200mAh rechargeable battery 2. No need for battery replacement 3. Eco-friendly and money-saving ✔ Easy to use & Cleanup 1. Easy cleanup 2. To Get rid of the splash when adjusting the speed level, please IMMERSE the frother/whisk into the liquids FIRST, then push the button to turn it on. This tip will eliminate the splash in 95% of cases. ❗ Usage Tips: 1. Put the milk frother into a container with drinks up to approx. 1/3 to start frothing. 2. Press and hold down the ON/OFF switch, the whisk will start to run and make foam. 3. As soon as the milk froth starts forming, lift the appliance slightly so that it always in the froth layer. 4. When the milk is frothy enough, let go of the switch to stop the whisk running. 5. Please remember to take your finger off the ON/OFF switch before lifting the whisk out of the milk to avoid spraying the liquid everywhere. 6. If you would like to make hot milk froth, the temperature of the milk should not be over 60℃/140℉, otherwise, the milk will not froth up perfectly. IF THERE’S ANY QUESTION, PLEASE CONTACT TO US AT ANY TIME.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t479myj-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CCopnts","source_asin":"B095CCBNMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095CCBNMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095CCBNMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
