window.products.push({"id":355813,"name":"JAR HEADS Rubber Jar Opener Gripper Pad 5 Pack - Thick 5 Inch Grippers for Opening Jars Made in the USA - Jar Opener for Weak Hands & Seniors with Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bUoiUp9+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Open Jars or Bottles Easier We have all been there. You grab a jar of pickles or a jar of olives and the lid will not budge no matter how hard you try. You may grab the kitchen towel and use it for a better grip but you still struggle to loosen the lid and strain yourself.  You grab your favorite beer with a twist top from the fridge and it hurts your hand trying to get the cap off. There is a simple cost effective way to solve this problem and that is with a high quality rubber gripper pad like these. Arthritis & Weak Hands Opening jars or bottles that have a tight seal can be tough for anyone. These rubber grips are a great bottle opener for arthritic hands and can help take some of the strain off by providing you with a superior grip then you could get from grabbing your dish towel or other methods to try and loosen a bottle or lid.  These are also great jar openers for seniors who may have lost some strength in their hands over the years. Quality Made to Last We know that there are cheaper options on the market, but you simply get what you pay for. Our grippers will not fall apart like the other cheap versions on the market. Jar Heads openers are made in the USA from a high quality rubber to ensure a tight grip that will become an invaluable addition to your kitchen accessories. Measurements Each Jar Opener measures 5 inches in diameter. ⭐Add to your cart today and see why these will become one of your favorite kitchen accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bUoiUp9+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JAR HEADS","source_asin":"B0BPBBKK3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPBBKK3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPBBKK3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
