window.products.push({"id":355845,"name":"Tesiplz Ozone Negative Ion Generator,20,000mg/h Digital Touch Commercial Ozonator Odor Removal Machine,Industrial O3 Ionizer Air Purifier Deodorizer f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M4mndksUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💨 Advanced Air Purification - Our ozone machine is a sleek and modern solution to improve the air quality in your home, office or vehicle. With its new digital display and touch button control, it's easy to use and looks great in any setting. 🌬️ Unique Negative Ion Mode - Our ozonizer includes a unique negative ion mode that improves air freshness by neutralizing pollutants and other floating particles in the air. This mode is not found in other similar products and is a great way to keep the air in your indoor environment clean and fresh. 🌱 Residue-free and Sterilizing - Our ozonator requires no consumables, is residue-free and sterilizes and deodorizes without any dead spots. It uses ozone to destroy the internal structure of micro-organisms and pollutants in the air, without the need for raw materials or filters. This makes it an eco-friendly and cost-effective way to purify the air. ⏰ Multiple Modes and Timer Function - Our ozone generator has three modes: ozone mode, negative ion mode, and automatic cycle mode. It also comes with a timer function that allows you to easily set it to start up and shut down at regular intervals each day. This is a great way to enjoy purified air without having to remember to turn it on and off. 🏠 Wide Range of Applications - Our ozone purifier is a versatile solution that can be used in commercial, industrial, domestic, and vehicle applications. It's perfect for removing a wide range of odors, including smoke and pet odors, making it a great addition to any indoor environment. Whether you're using it in your house, office, or vehicle, our ozone generator is an effective and reliable way to keep the air around you clean and fresh. ⚠️NOTE:USE IN UNOCCUPIED SPACE ONLY! While the machine is working, people and animals must leave the confined space in which the machine is located. Please wait for the machine to finish working and open the window for some time before entering the room.EPA Est. No. 102675-CHN-1.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M4mndksUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tesiplz","source_asin":"B0BY13JZBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY13JZBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY13JZBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
