window.products.push({"id":355949,"name":"Howard Miller Zoltan Mantel Clock 635-178 – Polished Chrome Finish, Walnut Wood Base, White Dial, Modern Home Decor, Quartz, Triple-Chime Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z3RAYPAiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MANTEL CLOCK: Make your indoor space look brighter and inviting with this Zoltan Chiming Mantel Clock. Its wide polished chrome bezel, chrome posts, and a chrome metal bottom base complements beautifully with a Walnut finished veneer wood base. DURABLE: This elegant wooden mantel clock looks fascinating with its large, stationary white dial, featuring black traditional Roman numerals (IIII instead of IV), black hour, and minute hands. With a highly polished and reflective metal finish, this clock with natural blemishes looks normal. HIGH QUALITY: This contemporary mantel clock with a quartz, triple-chime movement plays Westminster or Ave Maria chimes with strike on the hour with ¼, ½, and ¾ chimes accordingly; Westminster chime and strike on the hour only, or Bim Bam chime on the hour only. DIMENSIONS: This modern mantel clock has a height of 10.5 inches (27 cm), a width of 8 inches (20 cm), and a depth of 5 inches (13 cm). Powered and operated with a quartz, triple-chime movement and requires two C sized batteries (not included). HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world's leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine, and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z3RAYPAiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B00J4W1NCO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J4W1NCO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J4W1NCO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
