window.products.push({"id":355955,"name":"HomArt Cast Iron Welcome Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CjW9GZs5L._AC_SL1456_.jpg","description":"Send a message-the old-fashioned way-with this vintage-inspired cast-iron sign from HomArt. Decorative and useful, this little sign evokes a by-gone era with its distressed finish, hefty weight, and raised block-letters in black against a white background. Each end is drilled with a hole for easy mounting. This sign measures 9-1/4 by 3 by 1/4-inch. A wide range of other messages and symbols is also available. HomArt home accessories are created for everyday use by skilled artisans using all-natural, recycled, and new materials and simple, tasteful designs. HomArt-forging a contemporary link with the romantic past.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CjW9GZs5L._AC_SL1456_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomArt","source_asin":"B004ZWV9RM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004ZWV9RM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004ZWV9RM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":355956,"name":"Greaton, 9-Inch Firm Innerspring Mattress with 4” Wood Box Spring, Experience Durable and Supportive Sleep, 75\" x 48\", Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":460.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AtWHWTcQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 357-count coil firm tight top innerspring mattress is a popular type of mattress that features a high number of individual coils, typically made of steel, that are interconnected to provide a stable and supportive base. The term \"357 count\" refers to the total number of coils in the mattress, which is considered a high count that can provide excellent support and durability. The tight top design of this mattress means that there is no additional padding or cushioning layers between the coils and the sleeper, resulting in a firmer sleeping surface that can be beneficial for those who prefer a more supportive feel. The tight top design also allows for better airflow and breathability, which can be especially beneficial for those who tend to sleep hot or sweat during the night. In addition to its supportive and breathable design, the 357-count coil firm tight top innerspring mattress can provide good motion isolation, which means that movements on one side of the bed are less likely to disturb your sleep partner on the other side. This can be especially helpful for couples who have different sleep schedules or who tend to move around a lot during the night. Overall, the 357-count coil firm tight top innerspring mattress is a popular choice for those seeking a supportive, durable, and cost-effective sleeping surface that promotes a comfortable and restful night's sleep. With its high coil count, tight top design, and breathable construction, this mattress can be a great option for those who prefer a firmer feel and need good support for their spine and joints.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AtWHWTcQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greaton","source_asin":"B0BZG7L58L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-355956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZG7L58L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZG7L58L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
